          "Rate limits are per-second and per-month. Hitting the per-second limit returns 429 with a Retry-After header.",
          "Les limites de débit sont par seconde et par mois. Atteindre la limite par seconde renvoie 429 avec un en-tête Retry-After.",
        )}</p>

        <Card>
          <CardContent class="p-0 overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-sm">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b">
                  <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-muted-foreground">{t("Plan", "Forfait")}</th>
                  <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-muted-foreground">{t("Per sec", "Par seconde")}</th>
                  <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-muted-foreground">{t("Per month", "Par mois")}</th>
                  <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-muted-foreground">{t("Overage", "Dépassement")}</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {rateLimits.map((r) => (
                  <tr class="border-b last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/50">
                    <td class="p-3 font-semibold">{tb(r.plan)}</td>
                    <td class="p-3 font-mono text-xs">{r.perSec}</td>
                    <td class="p-3 font-mono text-xs">{r.perMonth}</td>
                    <td class="p-3 text-muted-foreground text-xs">{tb(r.overage)}</td>
                  </tr>
                ))}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </CardContent>
        </Card>
      </section>

      <Separator class="mb-16" />

      <!-- ═══ 08: ERRORS ═══ -->
      <section id="errors" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-24">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-mono text-muted-foreground mb-4">
          <span class="text-primary">[</span>          <span class="text-primary/80">10</span><span class="text-primary">]</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">{t("Errors", "Erreurs")}</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">{t("One shape. Specific categories.", "Une forme. Des catégories précises.")}</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6">{t(
          "All error responses carry",
          "Toutes les réponses d'erreur portent",
        )} <code class="px-1 py-0.5 bg-muted rounded text-xs font-mono">success: false</code>, {t(
          "a stable error",
          "un code d'erreur stable",
        )} <code class="px-1 py-0.5 bg-muted rounded text-xs font-mono">code</code>, {t(
          "an English",
          "un",
        )} <code class="px-1 py-0.5 bg-muted rounded text-xs font-mono">message</code> {t(
          "and a French",
          "et un",
        )} <code class="px-1 py-0.5 bg-muted rounded text-xs font-mono">message_fr</code> {t(
          "in French. Every error includes both languages so your app can render the right locale without a separate request.",
          "en français. Chaque erreur inclut les deux langues afin que votre application puisse afficher la bonne langue sans requête distincte.",
        )}</p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">{t("Bilingual Error Response", "Réponse d'erreur bilingue")}</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-3">{t(
          "Every API error returns both an English and a French message. Example 429 response:",
          "Chaque erreur API renvoie un message en anglais et en français. Exemple de réponse 429 :",
        )}</p>
        <Card class="mb-6">
          <CardContent class="p-4 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto">
            &#123;<br />
            &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-[#D4A017]">&quot;success&quot;</span>: false,<br />
            &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-[#D4A017]">&quot;error&quot;</span>: &#123;<br />
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-[#D4A017]">&quot;code&quot;</span>: <span class="text-[#0891B2]">&quot;RATE_LIMITED&quot;</span>,<br />
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-[#D4A017]">&quot;message&quot;</span>: <span class="text-[#0891B2]">&quot;Rate limit exceeded. Please slow down.&quot;</span>,<br />
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-[#D4A017]">&quot;message_fr&quot;</span>: <span class="text-[#0891B2]">&quot;Limite de débit dépassée. Veuillez ralentir.&quot;</span><br />
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&#125;<br />
            &#125;
          </CardContent>
        </Card>

        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-3">{t(
          "When building a French-language UI, display",
          "Lors de la création d'une interface en français, affichez",
        )} <code class="px-1 py-0.5 bg-muted rounded text-xs font-mono">message_fr</code> {t(
          "to your users. The",
          "à vos utilisateurs. Le champ",
        )} <code class="px-1 py-0.5 bg-muted rounded text-xs font-mono">message</code> {t(
          "field is always English and suitable for logging.",
          "est toujours en anglais et convient à la journalisation.",
        )}</p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">{t("Error reference", "Référence des erreurs")}</h3>

        <Card>
          <CardContent class="p-0 overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-sm">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b">
                  <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-muted-foreground">{t("Code", "Code")}</th>
                  <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-muted-foreground">{t("Status", "Statut")}</th>
                  <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-muted-foreground">{t("Retry", "Réessayer")}</th>
                  <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-muted-foreground">{t("Meaning", "Signification")}</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {errorCodes.map((e) => (
                  <tr class="border-b last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/50">
                    <td class="p-3 font-mono text-xs">{e.code}</td>
                    <td class="p-3">
                      <span class={`text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded ${
                        e.status === "401" || e.status === "402" || e.status === "500"
                          ? "text-red-500 bg-red-500/10"
                          : e.status === "429"
                          ? "text-orange-500 bg-orange-500/10"
                          : e.status === "502"
                          ? "text-yellow-500 bg-yellow-500/10"
                          : "text-muted-foreground bg-muted"
                      }`}>{e.status}</span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="p-3">
                      <span class={tb(e.retry) === "Oui" ? "text-emerald-500" : "text-muted-foreground"}>{tb(e.retry)}</span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="p-3 text-muted-foreground">{tb(e.meaning)}</td>
                  </tr>
                ))}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </CardContent>
        </Card>
      </section>

      <Separator class="mb-16" />

      <!-- ═══ 09: FAQ ═══ -->
      <section id="faq" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-24">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-mono text-muted-foreground mb-4">
          <span class="text-primary">[</span>          <span class="text-primary/80">11</span><span class="text-primary">]</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">{t("FAQ", "FAQ")}</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">{t("Common questions", "Questions fréquentes")}</h2>

        {[
          { q: { en: "Do I need a credit card to start?", fr: "Dois-je fournir une carte de crédit pour commencer ?" }, a: { en: "No. Free plan: 1,000 calls/month, every source, every SDK, citation hashes included. No card, no time limit.", fr: "Non. Forfait gratuit : 1 000 appels/mois, toutes les sources, tous les SDK, hachages de citation inclus. Pas de carte, pas de limite de temps." } },
          { q: { en: "What makes the citations verifiable?", fr: "Qu'est-ce qui rend les citations vérifiables ?" }, a: { en: "Every response includes source name, exact upstream URL, retrieval timestamp, and a SHA-256 content hash. You can re-fetch and confirm exactly what the agent saw.", fr: "Chaque réponse inclut le nom de la source, l'URL en amont exacte, l'horodatage de récupération et un hachage SHA-256 du contenu. Vous pouvez re-télécharger et confirmer exactement ce que l'agent a vu." } },
          { q: { en: "Which AI frameworks are supported?", fr: "Quels cadres IA sont pris en charge ?" }, a: { en: "MCP (Claude, Cursor, Windsurf, ChatGPT), Anthropic tool_use, OpenAI function calling. TypeScript and Python SDKs.", fr: "MCP (Claude, Cursor, Windsurf, ChatGPT), Anthropic tool_use, OpenAI function calling. SDK TypeScript et Python." } },
          { q: { en: "How fresh is the data?", fr: "Quelle est la fraîcheur des données ?" }, a: { en: "Depends on the source. Committee evidence: ~24h. Canada Gazette: within hours of publication. CanLII: daily. Every response ships with a freshness_seconds field.", fr: "Cela dépend de la source. Témoignages des comités : ~24 h. Gazette du Canada : quelques heures après publication. CanLII : quotidiennement. Chaque réponse est accompagnée d'un champ freshness_seconds." } },
          { q: { en: "What is the cross-reference engine?", fr: "Qu'est-ce que le moteur de recoupement ?" }, a: { en: "Search for any person or company and get their complete government footprint — lobbying meetings, committee testimony, GIC board appointments, procurement contracts, court cases, and campaign donations — in a unified timeline.", fr: "Recherchez une personne ou une entreprise et obtenez son empreinte gouvernementale complète — réunions de lobbying, témoignages en comité, nominations aux conseils par décret, contrats d'approvisionnement, dossiers judiciaires et dons de campagne — dans une chronologie unifiée." } },
          { q: { en: "Is my API key secure?", fr: "Ma clé API est-elle sécurisée ?" }, a: { en: "Keys are hashed with SHA-256 at rest — we only see them at verify time. HTTPS-only transit. Rotate from the workspace instantly.", fr: "Les clés sont hachées avec SHA-256 au repos — nous ne les voyons qu'au moment de la vérification. Transit HTTPS uniquement. Rotation instantanée depuis l'espace de travail." } },
        ].map((faq) => (
          <Card class="mb-4">
            <CardContent class="p-4">
              <p class="font-semibold mb-1">{tb(faq.q)}</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">{tb(faq.a)}</p>
            </CardContent>
          </Card>
        ))}
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
